					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   WaitForRoute::D__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   CurrentGoal::D__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   NextGoal::D__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   TranslateAuxiliaries::D__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   j0::D__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   j1::D__(id__)
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					 )
					 [[ConfigureOrigin::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_ConfigureOrigin|}]]
					 [[Reset::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_Reset|}]]
					 [[Unconfigured::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,config__.NID_Unconfigured.in|}]]
					 [[WaitForRoute::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,route__.NID_WaitForRoute.in|}]]
					 [[CurrentGoal::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_CurrentGoal,location__.NID_CurrentGoal.in,config__.NID_CurrentGoal.in|}]]
					 [[NextGoal::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_NextGoal|}]]
					 [[TranslateAuxiliaries::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_TranslateAuxiliaries|}]]
					 [[i0::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|internal__.NID_i0|}]]
					 [[j0::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|internal__.NID_j0,internal__.NID_j0|}]]
					 [[j1::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|internal__.NID_j1,internal__.NID_j1|}]]
					 )
					  [[ share__ <- x__ | x__ <- {| share__,setR_goalConfig,setR_locationLatest,setR_currentRoute |} ]] 
					  [[set_goalPoint <- setL_goalPoint,set_goalConfig <- setL_goalConfig,set_locationLatest <- setL_locationLatest,set_currentRoute <- setL_currentRoute]]
					 )
					 [| union(union(union(flowevts,transSync),{terminate}),{|share__
					 			,setL_goalPoint
					 			,setL_goalConfig
					 			,setL_locationLatest
					 			,setL_currentRoute
					 			,setR_goalConfig
					 			 			,setR_locationLatest
					 			 			,setR_currentRoute
					 			|}) |]
					 ((i0::enter -> Transitions(id__))
					  [[ share__ <- x__ | x__ <- {| share__,setL_goalPoint,setL_goalConfig,setL_locationLatest,setL_currentRoute |} ]]
					  [[set_goalConfig <- setR_goalConfig,set_locationLatest <- setR_locationLatest,set_currentRoute <- setR_currentRoute]]
					 )
					)[[setL_goalPoint <- set_goalPoint,setL_goalConfig <- set_goalConfig,setL_locationLatest <- set_locationLatest,setL_currentRoute <- set_currentRoute]]
					 [[setR_goalConfig <- set_goalConfig,setR_locationLatest <- set_locationLatest,setR_currentRoute <- set_currentRoute]]
					)
				)
				 \ hideSet)
				[[
					location__.x____ <- location,
					goal__.x____ <- goal,
					route__.x____ <- route,
					config__.x____ <- config,
					auxiliary_demand__.x____ <- auxiliary_demand,
					routeOrigin__.x____ <- routeOrigin
					| x____ <- NIDS
				]]
			)
			 [| {| interrupt |} |] SKIP)
		)
		)
	
	Behaviour(id__) = 
		dbisim((MachineBody(id__)\ enteredSS)
		)
	
	IteratedBehaviour(id__) = 
		dbisim((MachineBody(id__)\ enteredSS)
		)
	
	Stateful(id__) = 
		((
			(Behaviour(id__) [| union(getsetLocalChannels,{terminate}) |] varMemory(id__))
		 	\getsetLocalChannels
		)
		)
	
	IteratedStateful(id__) =
		(dbisim(
			sbisim(
				dbisim(
					sbisim(
						dbisim(
							sbisim(
								dbisim(
									sbisim(
										dbisim(
											sbisim(
												dbisim(
													sbisim(
														dbisim(
															sbisim(
																Behaviour(id__)
																[| {|get_goalAuxiliaries,set_goalAuxiliaries,terminate|} |]
																Memory_goalAuxiliaries((true,true,true,0,(0,0,"")))
															)\{|get_goalAuxiliaries,set_goalAuxiliaries|}
														)
														[| {|get_newObjective,set_newObjective,terminate|} |]
														Memory_newObjective((0,0,(0,0,0)))
													)\{|get_newObjective,set_newObjective|}
												)
												[| {|get_goalPoint,set_goalPoint,terminate|} |]
												Memory_goalPoint(((0,0,(0,0,"")),0,(true,true,true,0,(0,0,"")),0,0))
											)\{|get_goalPoint,set_goalPoint|}
										)
										[| {|get_locationLatest,set_locationLatest,terminate|} |]
										Memory_locationLatest((0,0,0))
									)\{|get_locationLatest,set_locationLatest|}
								)
								[| {|get_goalConfig,set_goalConfig,terminate|} |]
								Memory_goalConfig((0,0))
							)\{|get_goalConfig,set_goalConfig|}
						)
						[| {|get_currentRoute,set_currentRoute,terminate|} |]
						Memory_currentRoute(<>)
					)\{|get_currentRoute,set_currentRoute|}
				)
				[| {|get_origin,set_origin,terminate|} |]
				Memory_origin(((0,0,(0,0,"")),0,(true,true,true,0,(0,0,"")),0,0))
			)\{|get_origin,set_origin|}
		)
		)
	
	-- Visible counterparts
	MachineBody_VS_O(id__) = 
		dbisim((
		let
			finalNodesEntered = {||}
		within
			((let
				-- IMPLEMENTATION NOTE:
				-- Here the 'enter' channel set is calculated explicitly because of the use of CSPM 
				-- modules for defining the semantics of each node.
				enterSS = {|
				ConfigureOrigin::enter,
				Reset::enter,
				i0::enter,
				Unconfigured::enter,
				WaitForRoute::enter,
				CurrentGoal::enter,
				NextGoal::enter,
				TranslateAuxiliaries::enter,
				j0::enter,
				j1::enter
				|}
				hideSet = union(enterSS,{|exit,exited,internal__|})
			within 
				((let
					-- IMPLEMENTATION NOTE: the channel set 'enter' is calculated explicitly
					-- because CSPM modules are used for the semantics of Node.
					flowevts = union(enterSS,{|exit,exited,interrupt|})
					transSync = {|internal__.NID_ConfigureOrigin,internal__.NID_i0,config__.NID_Unconfigured.in,route__.NID_WaitForRoute.in,internal__.NID_Reset,internal__.NID_TranslateAuxiliaries,internal__.NID_CurrentGoal,location__.NID_CurrentGoal.in,internal__.NID_NextGoal,config__.NID_CurrentGoal.in,internal__.NID_j0,internal__.NID_j0,internal__.NID_j1,internal__.NID_j1|}
				within
					((
					 (((-- RULE composeNodes(nc:NodeContainer)^nops : CSPProcess
					   ConfigureOrigin::VS_O__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   Reset::VS_O__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   i0::VS_O__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   Unconfigured::VS_O__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   WaitForRoute::VS_O__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   CurrentGoal::VS_O__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   NextGoal::VS_O__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   TranslateAuxiliaries::VS_O__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   j0::VS_O__(id__)
					   [| { share__, terminate } |] (
					   j1::VS_O__(id__)
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					   )
					 )
					 [[ConfigureOrigin::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_ConfigureOrigin|}]]
					 [[Reset::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_Reset|}]]
					 [[Unconfigured::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,config__.NID_Unconfigured.in|}]]
					 [[WaitForRoute::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,route__.NID_WaitForRoute.in|}]]
					 [[CurrentGoal::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_CurrentGoal,location__.NID_CurrentGoal.in,config__.NID_CurrentGoal.in|}]]
					 [[NextGoal::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_NextGoal|}]]
					 [[TranslateAuxiliaries::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|interrupt,internal__.NID_TranslateAuxiliaries|}]]
					 [[i0::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|internal__.NID_i0|}]]
					 [[j0::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|internal__.NID_j0,internal__.NID_j0|}]]
					 [[j1::interrupt <- x__ | x__ <- {|internal__.NID_j1,internal__.NID_j1|}]]
					 )
					  [[ share__ <- x__ | x__ <- {| share__,setR_goalConfig,setR_locationLatest,setR_currentRoute |} ]] 
					  [[set_goalPoint <- setL_goalPoint,set_goalConfig <- setL_goalConfig,set_locationLatest <- setL_locationLatest,set_currentRoute <- setL_currentRoute]]
					 )
					 [| union(union(union(flowevts,transSync),{terminate}),{|share__
					 			,setL_goalPoint
					 			,setL_goalConfig
					 			,setL_locationLatest
					 			,setL_currentRoute
					 			,setR_goalConfig
					 			 			,setR_locationLatest
					 			 			,setR_currentRoute
					 			|}) |]
					 ((i0::enter -> Transitions(id__))
					  [[ share__ <- x__ | x__ <- {| share__,setL_goalPoint,setL_goalConfig,setL_locationLatest,setL_currentRoute |} ]]
					  [[set_goalConfig <- setR_goalConfig,set_locationLatest <- setR_locationLatest,set_currentRoute <- setR_currentRoute]]
					 )
					)[[setL_goalPoint <- set_goalPoint,setL_goalConfig <- set_goalConfig,setL_locationLatest <- set_locationLatest,setL_currentRoute <- set_currentRoute]]
					 [[setR_goalConfig <- set_goalConfig,setR_locationLatest <- set_locationLatest,setR_currentRoute <- set_currentRoute]]
					)
				)
				 \ hideSet)
				[[
					location__.x____ <- location,
					goal__.x____ <- goal,
					route__.x____ <- route,
					config__.x____ <- config,
					auxiliary_demand__.x____ <- auxiliary_demand,
					routeOrigin__.x____ <- routeOrigin
					| x____ <- NIDS
				]]
			)
			 [| {| interrupt |} |] SKIP)
		)
		)
	
	Behaviour_VS_O(id__) = 
		dbisim((MachineBody_VS_O(id__))
		)
	
	IteratedBehaviour_VS_O(id__) = 
		dbisim((MachineBody_VS_O(id__))
		)
	
	Stateful_VS_O(id__) = 
		dbisim((
			(Behaviour_VS_O(id__) [| union(getsetLocalChannels,{terminate}) |] varMemory(id__))
		 	\getsetLocalChannels
		)
		)
	
	IteratedStateful_VS_O(id__) =
		(dbisim(
			sbisim(
				dbisim(
					sbisim(
						dbisim(
							sbisim(
								dbisim(
									sbisim(
										dbisim(
											sbisim(
												dbisim(
													sbisim(
														dbisim(
															sbisim(
																Behaviour_VS_O(id__)
																[| {|get_goalAuxiliaries,set_goalAuxiliaries,terminate|} |]
																Memory_goalAuxiliaries((true,true,true,0,(0,0,"")))
															)\{|get_goalAuxiliaries,set_goalAuxiliaries|}
														)
														[| {|get_newObjective,set_newObjective,terminate|} |]
														Memory_newObjective((0,0,(0,0,0)))
													)\{|get_newObjective,set_newObjective|}
												)
												[| {|get_goalPoint,set_goalPoint,terminate|} |]
												Memory_goalPoint(((0,0,(0,0,"")),0,(true,true,true,0,(0,0,"")),0,0))
											)\{|get_goalPoint,set_goalPoint|}
										)
										[| {|get_locationLatest,set_locationLatest,terminate|} |]
										Memory_locationLatest((0,0,0))
									)\{|get_locationLatest,set_locationLatest|}
								)
								[| {|get_goalConfig,set_goalConfig,terminate|} |]
								Memory_goalConfig((0,0))
							)\{|get_goalConfig,set_goalConfig|}
						)
						[| {|get_currentRoute,set_currentRoute,terminate|} |]
						Memory_currentRoute(<>)
					)\{|get_currentRoute,set_currentRoute|}
				)
				[| {|get_origin,set_origin,terminate|} |]
				Memory_origin(((0,0,(0,0,"")),0,(true,true,true,0,(0,0,"")),0,0))
			)\{|get_origin,set_origin|}
		)
		)
	
	-- END
	
	-- Memory
	-- Memory variables
	Memory_origin(origin) =
		get_origin!origin -> Memory_origin(origin)
		[]
		set_origin?x__ -> Memory_origin(x__)
		[]
		terminate -> SKIP
	Memory_currentRoute(currentRoute) =
		get_currentRoute!currentRoute -> Memory_currentRoute(currentRoute)
		[]
		set_currentRoute?x__ -> Memory_currentRoute(x__)
		[]
		terminate -> SKIP
	Memory_goalConfig(goalConfig) =
		get_goalConfig!goalConfig -> Memory_goalConfig(goalConfig)
		[]
		set_goalConfig?x__ -> Memory_goalConfig(x__)
		[]
		terminate -> SKIP
	Memory_locationLatest(locationLatest) =
		get_locationLatest!locationLatest -> Memory_locationLatest(locationLatest)
		[]
		set_locationLatest?x__ -> Memory_locationLatest(x__)
		[]
		terminate -> SKIP
	Memory_goalPoint(goalPoint) =
		get_goalPoint!goalPoint -> Memory_goalPoint(goalPoint)
		[]
		set_goalPoint?x__ -> Memory_goalPoint(x__)
		[]
		terminate -> SKIP
	Memory_newObjective(newObjective) =
		get_newObjective!newObjective -> Memory_newObjective(newObjective)
		[]
		set_newObjective?x__ -> Memory_newObjective(x__)
		[]
		terminate -> SKIP
	Memory_goalAuxiliaries(goalAuxiliaries) =
		get_goalAuxiliaries!goalAuxiliaries -> Memory_goalAuxiliaries(goalAuxiliaries)
		[]
		set_goalAuxiliaries?x__ -> Memory_goalAuxiliaries(x__)
		[]
		terminate -> SKIP
	
	-- varMemory process
	varMemory(id__) = Memory_origin(((0,0,(0,0,"")),0,(true,true,true,0,(0,0,"")),0,0))
	[| { terminate } |] (
	Memory_currentRoute(<>)
	[| { terminate } |] (
	Memory_goalConfig((0,0))
	[| { terminate } |] (
	Memory_locationLatest((0,0,0))
	[| { terminate } |] (
	Memory_goalPoint(((0,0,(0,0,"")),0,(true,true,true,0,(0,0,"")),0,0))
	[| { terminate } |] (
	Memory_newObjective((0,0,(0,0,0)))
	[| { terminate } |] (
	Memory_goalAuxiliaries((true,true,true,0,(0,0,"")))
	)
	)
	)
	)
	)
	)
	
	getsetLocalChannels = {|get_origin,set_origin,get_currentRoute,set_currentRoute,get_goalConfig,set_goalConfig,get_locationLatest,set_locationLatest,get_goalPoint,set_goalPoint,get_newObjective,set_newObjective,get_goalAuxiliaries,set_goalAuxiliaries|}
	
	-- Definition of the behaviour of state machines (default, optimised, visible, visible and optimised)
	FVS__(id__) = STM_VS_O(id__)
	
	D__(id__) = STM(id__) \ internal_events
	O__(id__) = sbisim(diamond(D__(id__)))
	VS__(id__) = FVS__(id__)
	VS_O__(id__) = sbisim(diamond(FVS__(id__)))
	HEXT__(id__) = O__(id__) [|shared_variable_events|] SKIP
	HUP__(id__) = O__(id__) [|{share__}|] SKIP
	
	-- Shared memory
	-- Shared memory variables
	
	-- sharedVarMemory process
	sharedVarMemory(id__) = terminate -> SKIP
	
	sharedVarSync = {||}
	
	sharedVarHide = {||}
endmodule


endmodule
